<section id="sugi-review" class="sugi-admin" data-sugi-admin data-endpoint="<%= it.assistantEndpoint %>"><header class="sugi-heading"><div><p class="workspace-kicker">REVIEWED HELP</p><h2>Sugi review</h2><p>Find missing FAQ topics and review answer feedback. Nothing is published automatically.</p></div><button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-sugi-admin-reload>Refresh</button></header><p role="status" data-sugi-admin-status>Loading review data…</p><div class="sugi-metric-grid" data-sugi-stats></div><div class="sugi-grid"><section class="sugi-card"><h3>Knowledge gaps</h3><p>Safe topic keywords only. Original questions and conversations are not retained.</p><div data-sugi-gaps></div></section><section class="sugi-card"><h3>Answers needing attention</h3><p>Negative feedback identifies the answer and knowledge version for review.</p><div data-sugi-negative></div></section></div><section class="sugi-card"><h3>Requests per day · last 30 days</h3><div data-sugi-daily></div></section><nav class="sugi-compose-actions" aria-label="Review pages"><button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-sugi-prev disabled>Previous</button><span data-sugi-page>Page 1</span><button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-sugi-next>Next</button></nav><% if(it.schoolEditor) { %><p>Add missing school information to School knowledge. Optional FAQs are only for exact answer wording. Feedback never changes live answers automatically.</p><% } else { %><p>To publish app FAQs: review the copied Markdown, supply verified facts and translations, update the knowledge version, then deploy. Placeholders cannot become live answers.</p><% } %></section>